  "body": "It's not hard to see why the owners thought this would be their forever home! Stunning in both design and presentation, with a wonderfully family-friendly layout and indoor-outdoor flow that's hard to beat, 21 Symes Drive really is something special. The current owners are ready to pass this much-loved home on to another lucky family.\r\n\r\nJust three years young and built by Fletcher Homes, this stunning four-bedroom home sits proudly on a quiet corner site in the heart of Red Beach. From the moment you step inside, there's an immediate sense of space and understated elegance, with beautifully connected living areas and an effortless flow to an outdoor entertaining space begging for BBQs and sundowners. This is a home that's been designed for families to enjoy, with room to come together, space to spread out and a wonderful flow between inside and out.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the features we think you'll love:\r\n\r\n- Four spacious, light filled bedrooms and two bathrooms provide plenty of room for the whole family, with a well-considered floor plan that makes the most of every space\r\n- At the heart of the home is a gorgeous open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, where natural light pours in and the easy connection between spaces makes everyday living and entertaining a pleasure\r\n- A separate lounge is such a bonus for family life, giving the kids their own space to relax while the grown-ups enjoy a little peace and quiet, or providing the perfect spot for cosy movie nights together\r\n- The indoor-outdoor flow is an absolute highlight! The main living area opens seamlessly onto a fabulous deck with a stunning louvred pergola, creating a wonderful extension of the home. Surrounded by greenery and overlooking the lawn, this is a fabulous space for morning coffees and summer dining \r\n- The corner site adds to the sense of space and openness, while the double garage with internal access makes life that little bit easier\r\n\r\nThere is so much to love about the location too! Red Beach is such a wonderful place to call home, with its beautiful beach and surf club, local shops and friendly community all close by. Easy motorway access makes commuting a breeze, while zoning for Red Beach School and Whangaparaoa College adds even more appeal for families.\r\n\r\nWith the quality of a Fletchers build, the reassurance of the remainder of a Master Build Guarantee and all the comforts of a home that is just two years young, this is a very special home that is daring you to fall in love! Come along to one of our open homes or give Tyler Broughton or Nicole Donovan a call to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nAuction: 4:00pm, Thursday 10th December 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here: https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
